----------------------------------------------------------------------
@salusoft89/planegcs (LGPL-2.0-or-later)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

NexyFab uses `@salusoft89/planegcs`, a WebAssembly port of the
planegcs 2D Geometric Constraint Solver originally developed as part of
the FreeCAD project (https://www.freecadweb.org/).

  - Upstream solver source (C++):
    https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/tree/main/src/Mod/Sketcher/App/planegcs
  - WASM/TypeScript port (Salusoft89):
    https://github.com/Salusoft89/planegcs
  - npm package:
    https://www.npmjs.com/package/@salusoft89/planegcs

License: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later
         (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-2.1.html)

NexyFab loads the planegcs WebAssembly module dynamically at runtime via
standard ES module `import`. Users wishing to substitute a modified
version of planegcs may do so by replacing the package in node_modules
or by overriding the WASM URL via the documented `init_planegcs_module`
options.

Acknowledgments: FreeCAD contributors (original solver) and the
Salusoft89 maintainers (WASM port + TypeScript bindings).

